Original Statement:
------------------
SELECT 
  TPCDS.PROMOTION.P_START_DATE_SK,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK 
FROM 
  TPCDS.PROMOTION 
  INNER JOIN TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 
  ON TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK = TPCDS.PROMOTION.P_END_DATE_SK 
WHERE 
  TPCDS.PROMOTION.P_RESPONSE_TARGET = 1 AND 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_YEAR >= 1912


Optimized Statement:
-------------------
SELECT 
  Q1.P_START_DATE_SK AS "P_START_DATE_SK",
  Q2.D_DATE_SK AS "D_DATE_SK" 
FROM 
  TPCDS.PROMOTION AS Q1,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 AS Q2 
WHERE 
  (Q2.D_DATE_SK = Q1.P_END_DATE_SK) AND 
  (1912 <= Q2.D_YEAR) AND 
  (Q1.P_RESPONSE_TARGET = 1)

Explain level:    Explain from section

